  "body": "carezone.uz MVP: katalog, profillar, bron, blog, SEO\n\n- Next.js 15 TS + Tailwind/shadcn base\n- Prisma + Postgres schema (users, doctors, clinics, services, schedules, slots, bookings, reviews, Q&A, blog, banners)\n- NextAuth (JWT), booking API (email confirm), iCal export\n- Clinic/Doctor pages with booking table\n- Blog index/post, JSON-LD (MedicalOrganization, Physician)\n- Telegram CTA, domain-for-sale banner, disclaimers\n\nSetup:\n1) cp .env.local.example .env.local and fill vars (DB, SMTP, NEXTAUTH_SECRET)\n2) npm run prisma:generate && npm run prisma:migrate\n3) npm run prisma:seed\n4) npm run dev\n",
